COBOL Debugger local test packaging

The original debugger software uses the Zero-Clause BSD license in LICENSE.
The bundled Countries and EU Cities data are adapted from GeoNames under
CC BY 4.0. See examples/DATA-SOURCES.md for attribution and changes.
Other imported example material still needs a redistribution review. The code
license does not grant rights to third-party dependencies or material.
These combined packages are prepared for local testing pending that review.
